  "description": "YITAMOTOR floor mats completely line the interior carpet to provide all-encompassing protection. We are confident that our products will surpass your expectations and make you a happy customer!\nFitment\n2014-2021 Toyota Tundra CrewMax Cab with Coverage Under 2nd Row Seat\n2nd row liner covers under the 2nd row seats\nNot fit with 1st row bench seat\nNot for vinyl flooring,only for carpet flooring.\nFor your safety, professional installation is highly recommended.\nFeatures\nCustom Fit: These floor mats are compatible with 2014-2021 Toyota Tundra CrewMax Cab with Coverage Under 2nd Row Seat,SR5/TRD/Limited/Trial/Platium/Nightshade/1794 Edition, not for vehicles with vinyl floors; 3D laser scanning technology gives full protection to both the front and back;Please Not: Not Fit Double Cab/Regular Cab\nSafe & Durable: YITAMOTOR floor liners are made with non toxic TPE material to ensure safe use even in extremely hot weather; The product contains no latex, cadmium, lead, or harmful PVC; High tensity TPE material provides a superb feel and extreme wear-resistance, as well as constant flexibility even in harsh cold weather\nALL WEATHER PROTECTION & NON SLIPPERY: The unique designed channels and raised edge can effectively trap water, snow, and sand to keep your car and shoes clean; Even in wet conditions, the hooks can effectively prevent the mats from slipping\nEasy To Clean: The textured skid surface is easily cleaned; Neither cumbersome vacuum cleaners nor harsh chemicals are needed; Simply shake them out or spray them down with a hose\nWhy Choose Yitamotor: Our floor mats are processed with advanced technology, rendering tailored protection and all-weather guard to your vehicle",
  "highlights": [
    "They securely attach to your vehicle using the original factory clasps, keeping the floor liners firmly in place and preventing unwanted shifting during daily driving.",
    "The raised edges provide maximum vehicle coverage, Floor Liners accurately and completely line the vehicle carpet giving absolute interior protection.",
    "Specially designed channels ensure the liner effectively contain the liquid to keep your vehicle and shoes clean, non-slip design for safe driving."
